he cinematic Wonder Woman pops  on a pair of specs as part of her  disguise to blend in with lowly humans  it's quickly called out by Etta candy as  being completely ridiculous  because honestly it's about time someone  did official business because Bruce  Wayne is the richest man in the world he  can afford to send armored cars anywhere  he wants even if they just contain a  single photograph made while the rest of  the 99% just has to settle for the post  office losing their birthday presents in  the black hole that is New Jersey still  when Bruce sends around his Wayne  Mobile's you'd think he'd be a little  more subtle about the fact that he's the  guy at stumbling a group of superhumans  called the Justice League but know when  you're Wayne's level of rich  you spring for vanity plates and you  make sure those plates have the initials  of your super-secret team on them having  the letters JL lead off your armored  cars the license plate is real subtle  Bruce what does your other car say I'm  Batman  God killer so as we learn by the end of  the movie it turns out to the magical  God killer sword can actually kill God  and just like in the after-school  specials of your the power to kick some  godly butt was inside Diana all along as  far as DC Comics is concerned that God  killers sword is generally the domain of  the mercenary villain known as  Deathstroke the Terminator the far too  powerful weapon was crafted by one god  to kill another and was given to Earth's  greatest assassin so while it's clear  that Wonder Woman's big screen sword  wasn't the real deal there are rumblings  of Deathstroke appearing in the DC EU  could we get a look at the real god  Killer sword in the future Amazon Prime  while it's not really an easter egg DC  went all out in including Princess  Diana's many many friends and relatives  inste mascara while some were named on  screen a handful are only mentioned in  the credits every single one of these  Amazon's has had a few comic pages  dedicated to them even if most of them  are largely interchangeable warrior  women but maybe we'll see a couple of  them again in Wonder Woman - it's a  miracle there's not a whole lot of  information about that mystery gas  general ludendorf was snorting in order  to Hulk out but DC Comics is a pretty  weird history of its heroes and villains  taking strange substances to perform  superhuman tasks  one early example of this appeared in  1940 under the name moralo a miracle  vitamin that enabled a Golden Age hero  Power Man to do heroic things 460  action-packed minutes while Morocco was  developed for positive purposes it  eventually fell into the wrong hands and  became a substance that Batman fans will  be very familiar with venom whether or  not doctor poisons power up gas will  eventually find its way into the  bubbling tubes of the supervillain Bane  is anyone's guess but the foundations  have been laid to break the back of  batfleck thanks for watching click the  looper icon to subscribe to our youtube  channel plus check all this cool stuff  we know you love to  [Music]
 

